<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 20.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIXTURES -</p>
<p>Seastar II (built 1083) 28,234 dwt prompt So.Africa/USAC or USG $4,000 daily M &amp; R.</p>
<p>Alpheos (built 1984) 63,640 dwt 1-10/10 off NoPac redel F.East $6,000 daily $80,000 bonus KoreaLine.</p>
<p>Kyriacos M (built 1976) 34,368 dwt prompt del Boulogne/redel Red Sea $9,200 daily Grand Moulin.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
